d. Permitted accent materials. Accent building materials for all exterior wall facades may include brick and wood panels (including wood shake).
e. Exceptions. Vinyl products shall only be used for soffits, eaves, and fascia. Any window trim shall be cementitious siding (Hardiboard) only.
f. Color. All materials shall be earth-tone in color, as approved by the design review commission and the mayor and city council.
g. Roofing materials. All asphalt-shingle roofing shall consist of high-quality, architectural shingles, with a minimum 30-year warranty. Metal roofing is also permitted.
h. Developer's agreement. A developer's agreement specifying all pertinent exterior design standards shall be approved by the mayor and city council prior to construction of developments involving duplexes.
